        ":question/problem": "Find $\\text{rank}(A)$ given that\n\n$$\n\\text{Null}(A)=\\left\\{\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}-{x}_{3} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix}\\,|\\,\\,{x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3}\\in R\\right\\}.\n$$",
